# Files Cloudflare Workers should NOT upload as site assets.
# wrangler.toml serves the repo root ("."), so anything here that isn't part
# of the site is skipped. (The .git pack alone is >25 MiB, the per-file limit.)
.git
.github
.claude
.gitignore
.DS_Store
node_modules
checks
tools
*.mjs
package.json
package-lock.json
CLAUDE.md
SKILL.md
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
_site
lawn
temporary screenshots
